  },
  "section": "8.67",
  "rulesText": "As they overcome challenges and complete adventures, characters earn Experience Points (XP), which are awarded by the Game Master. When a character's XP total crosses certain thresholds, the character's level increases. See also “Level Advancement.”"
}
